ilove-team-1938.jpg","c":"This is part of the team that won the famous 'Waddilove' trophy at Birchfield in 1938, beating L.A.C., Blackheath, Birchfield, Polytechnic and Achilles.","id":"B166-07","w":"June 1968"},{"f":"crops/B176/B176-p07-surrey-xc-1928.jpg","c":"SURREY COUNTY X-CTY CHAMPIONSHIP c.1928 L.to R: W.J.Harwood (Surrey AC) 1st.,L.H.Weatherill (SLH) 2nd., E.A.Duffett (Belgrave) 3rd.","id":"B176-09","w":"December 1970"},{"f":"crops/B116/B116-p2-president.jpg","c":"","id":"B116-04","w":"December 1952"}],"photo":{"file":"crops/B116/B116-p2-president.jpg","caption":null,"source":"B116-04","when":"December 1952"},"x":1,"share":{"d":"Ernie Duffett in The Belgravian, the Belgrave Harriers club gazette, 1927–2007: 131 mentions in 77 issues, 70 race results and 7 photographs. Wrote or reported 45 items.","img":"https://belgravian-images.stephendgardner.workers.dev/belgravian/crops/B179/B179-p40-surrey-county-race-start.jpg","u":"https://stephengardner1.github.io/belgrave-harriers-data/belgravian/read/share/p-ernie-duffett.html"},"legend":false}